          "text": "Hello, my name is William Coat and I'm going to show you how to tie the scrunchie or wedding"
        },
        {
          "start": 6.49,
          "end": 6.87,
          "text": "crevette."
        },
        {
          "start": 7.21,
          "end": 12.19,
          "text": "First off, do up your top button on your wing collar shirt, it could be a standard wing"
        },
        {
          "start": 12.19,
          "end": 14.45,
          "text": "or a deep wing depending on how you want to wear it."
        },
        {
          "start": 14.93,
          "end": 22.31,
          "text": "It goes round the collar and roughly where one of the blades comes up, in fact it's"
        },
        {
          "start": 22.31,
          "end": 26.31,
          "text": "out, that should be level with one of your top button and then it's very straightforward."
        },
        {
          "start": 26.31,
          "end": 37.11,
          "text": "You take one end over the other, round the back, round the front, come up from the back,"
        },
        {
          "start": 38.37,
          "end": 43.27,
          "text": "pull the way through, try not to pull the knot too tight because you want a nice big"
        },
        {
          "start": 43.27,
          "end": 43.99,
          "text": "ruffled knot."
        },
        {
          "start": 44.77,
          "end": 51.61,
          "text": "You take the shorter blade, push it through the front, pull down, and then just pull"
        },
        {
          "start": 51.61,
          "end": 54.29,
          "text": "up to cover your top up."
        },
        {
          "start": 56.15,
          "end": 60.45,
          "text": "You might need to look in the mirror at this point or get someone to help you and don't"
        },
        {
          "start": 60.45,
          "end": 64.01,
          "text": "worry about the blade lengths because they will all be tucked under the waistcoat that"
        },
        {
          "start": 64.01,
          "end": 65.23,
          "text": "will come up at least to here."
        },
        {
          "start": 65.81,
          "end": 71.99,
          "text": "All we're interested in doing is making sure we've got a nice, rich, large knot that"
        },
        {
          "start": 71.99,
          "end": 75.77,
          "text": "covers your top button and makes the whole scrunch look attractive."
        },
        {
          "start": 77.11,
          "end": 77.77,
          "text": "There we go."
        }
